 *
 * @param list<float> $values Finite observations concatenated by group.
 * @param list<int> $groupSizes At least two groups of size two or larger, each with positive variance.
 * @param float $confidenceLevel Desired simultaneous coverage in (0,1), default 0.95.
 * @return list<GamesHowellComparison> Owned comparisons in order (1,0), (2,0), (2,1), and so on.
 * @throws InvalidArgumentException C++ `std::invalid_argument`: Invalid inputs, numerical overflow or an unresolved critical value.
 * @see welch_anova()
 * @see studentized_range_cdf()
