 * ```
 *
 * **References**
 *
 * - https://stat.ethz.ch/R-manual/R-devel/library/stats/html/kruskal.test.html
 *
 * @param list<float> $values Finite observations concatenated by group.
 * @param list<int> $groupSizes At least two positive group sizes summing to values.size().
 * @return HypothesisTestResult statistic=H, parameter1=k-1 and upper-tail approximate p_value; no CI.
 * @throws InvalidArgumentException C++ `std::invalid_argument`: Invalid groups, nonfinite input or all observations tied.
 * @see HypothesisTestResult
 */
