 * @return list<DunnComparison> Owned comparisons in order (1,0), (2,0), (2,1), and so on.
 * @throws InvalidArgumentException C++ `std::invalid_argument`: Invalid groups or zero pooled rank variation.
 * @see kruskal_wallis_test()
 * @see p_adjust()
 */
