 * @param bool $correct True (default) corrects the score test and adds a half-count CI width.
 * @param float $confLevel Finite confidence level in (0,1), default .95.
 * @return HypothesisTestResult statistic=z^2, parameter1=1, estimates=sample proportions, p_value and confidence bounds for p1-p2, clamped to [-1,1].
 * @throws InvalidArgumentException C++ `std::invalid_argument`: Invalid counts, alternative or confidence level.
 * @see HypothesisTestResult
