 * @param float $confLevel Finite confidence level in (0,1), default .95.
 * @return HypothesisTestResult statistic=successes, parameter1=n, estimate1=successes/n, p_value and Clopper-Pearson interval; one-sided intervals end at zero/one.
 * @throws InvalidArgumentException C++ `std::invalid_argument`: Invalid counts, probability, alternative or confidence level.
 * @see HypothesisTestResult
 */
