 * @param float $confidenceLevel Two-sided nominal confidence level in (0,1), default .95.
 * @return RiskRatioInterval Risk ratio estimate and lower and upper score bounds.
 * @throws InvalidArgumentException C++ `std::invalid_argument`: Invalid counts or confidence level.
 * @see newcombe_difference_interval()
 * @see RiskRatioInterval
 */
