 * @throws InvalidArgumentException C++ `std::invalid_argument`: On empty or mismatched inputs, or non-finite data.
 * @throws NativeException C++ `std::runtime_error`: If the normal equations are singular (some basis function has too little data; use a penalized fit or fewer functions).
 * @see fit_tensor_pspline()
 */
